    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skrunkly gets a meal deal, you do just that! the objective is to make your way all the way to Schmesco to get its infamous meal deal and bring it back to your new friend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/706de7663dee0f4bed54e57f271df618.avif?t=1747689626\" width=440 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through lots of different environments from abandoned factories to broken railways all the way to villages filled with elves and gnomes, meet new friends and foes and lastly work hard and keep trying to make your way through the dangerous and some what random world that you are surviving in.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/012e9b6e00a9ffdf3c572b018da7fa09.avif?t=1747689626\" width=536 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This platformer is designed for you to fail and fail and fail and keep trying your best to get over all the obstacles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thrown your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and one last thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >try not to end up like this guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/ce08bc4628b339d8c329de6c6fda6b31.avif?t=1747689626\" width=318 height=280 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skrunkly gets a meal deal, you do just that! the objective is to make your way all the way to Schmesco to get its infamous meal deal and bring it back to your new friend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/706de7663dee0f4bed54e57f271df618.avif?t=1747689626\" width=440 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through lots of different environments from abandoned factories to broken railways all the way to villages filled with elves and gnomes, meet new friends and foes and lastly work hard and keep trying to make your way through the dangerous and some what random world that you are surviving in.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/012e9b6e00a9ffdf3c572b018da7fa09.avif?t=1747689626\" width=536 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This platformer is designed for you to fail and fail and fail and keep trying your best to get over all the obstacles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thrown your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and one last thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >try not to end up like this guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378770/extras/ce08bc4628b339d8c329de6c6fda6b31.avif?t=1747689626\" width=318 height=280 /></span></p>",
